<title>PHILIPPINES: Solid Group says 6-month sales down one pct.</title>
<headline>Solid Group says 6-month sales down one pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics manufacturer Solid Group Inc said on Monday total sales value went down 1.14 percent to 3.37 billion pesos in the first six months of the year from 3.41 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>A 37 percent decline in export sales offset a 19 percent rise in domestic sales.</p>
<p>Solid is the sole franchise holder of Sony Corp and Aiwa Co Ltd products in the Philippines.</p>
